        <gr str="3652">thus </gr>to <gr str="5922">them</gr>, <gr str="4479">Who </gr>hath <gr str="7761 2942">commanded </gr>you to <gr str="1124">build </gr>
        <gr str="1836">this </gr>
        <gr str="1005">house</gr>, and to make <gr str="3635">up </gr>
        <gr str="1836">this </gr>
