        <gr str="1836">this </gr>
        <gr str="1005">house</gr>, and to <gr str="3635">finish </gr>
        <gr str="1836">these </gr>
        <gr str="846">walls</gr>?</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="10">We <gr str="7593">asked </gr>their <gr str="8036">names </gr>
        <gr str="638">also</gr>, to <gr str="3046">inform </gr>thee, that we might <gr str="3790">write </gr>the <gr str="8036">names </gr>of the <gr str="1400">men </gr>that <STYLE css="font-style:italic">were</STYLE> the <gr str="7217">chief </gr>of them.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="11">And <gr str="3660">thus </gr>they <gr str="8421">returned </gr>us <gr str="6600">answer</gr>, <gr str="560">saying</gr>, <gr str="586">We </gr>
        <gr str="1994">are </gr>the <gr str="5649">servants </gr>of the <gr str="426">God </gr>of <gr str="8065">heaven </gr>and <gr str="772">earth</gr>, and <gr str="1124">build </gr>the <gr str="1005">house </gr>that <gr str="1934">was </gr>
        <gr str="1124">built </gr>
        <gr str="1836">these </gr>
        <gr str="7690">many </gr>
        <gr str="8140">years </gr>
        <gr str="6928">ago</gr>, which a <gr str="7229">great </gr>
        <gr str="4430">king </gr>of <gr str="3479">Israel </gr>
        <gr str="1124">built </gr>and set <gr str="3635">up</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="12">
        <gr str="3861">But </gr>
        <gr str="4481">after </gr>that our <gr str="2">fathers </gr>had <gr str="7265">provoked </gr>the <gr str="426">God </gr>of <gr str="8065">heaven </gr>to <gr str="7265">wrath</gr>, he <gr str="3052">gave </gr>
        <gr str="1994">them </gr>into the <gr str="3028">hand </gr>of <gr str="5020">Nebuchadnezzar </gr>the <gr str="4430">king </gr>of <gr str="895">Babylon</gr>, the <gr str="3679">Chaldean</gr>, who <gr str="5642">destroyed </gr>
        <gr str="1836">this </gr>
        <gr str="1005">house</gr>, and <gr str="1541">carried </gr>the <gr str="5972">people </gr>
        <gr str="1541">away </gr>into <gr str="895">Babylon</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="13">
        <gr str="1297">But </gr>in the <gr str="2298">first </gr>
        <gr str="8140">year </gr>of <gr str="3567">Cyrus </gr>the <gr str="4430">king </gr>of <gr str="895">Babylon </gr>
