        <gr str="5312">took </gr>out <gr str="4481">of </gr>the <gr str="1965">temple </gr>that <STYLE css="font-style:italic">was</STYLE> in <gr str="3390">Jerusalem</gr>, and <gr str="2987">brought </gr>them into the <gr str="1965">temple </gr>of <gr str="895">Babylon</gr>, <gr str="1994">those </gr>did <gr str="3567">Cyrus </gr>the <gr str="4430">king </gr>
        <gr str="5312">take </gr>out <gr str="4481">of </gr>the <gr str="1965">temple </gr>of <gr str="895">Babylon</gr>, and they were <gr str="3052">delivered </gr>to <STYLE css="font-style:italic">one</STYLE>, whose <gr str="8036">name </gr>
